# @name: curl | POST Form Data
# @description: Makes a POST request with form data Group: Curl Basic HTTP Requests. Template: replace placeholders before running. {field1} = First form field name [default "username"] | {value1} = First form field value | {field2} = Second form field name [default "password"] | {value2} = Second form field value | {url} = URL to request
curl -X POST -d "{field1}={value1}&{field2}={value2}" {url}